# Module-local Maven/IDE exclusions layered over the repository rules. Generated
# outputs are rebuilt from this module's POM and the backend parent reactor; authored
# Java/resources/tests remain tracked. Keep runtime credentials outside source trees.

HELP.md
target/
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

